	"TagLine": "Jump over things!",
	"Description": "**Jump Over** lets you jump over things!\n\n**Install**\n\n1.  Install the latest version of [SMAPI](https://smapi.io).\n\n2.  Unzip the mod folder into [font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font].\n\n3.  Run the game using SMAPI.\n**Use**\nPress [font=Courier New]Space[/font] (configurable) to jump; do it while walking towards something (like a fence) to jump over it.\n\n**Compatibility**\nCompatible with Stardew Valley 1.5.5+ on Linux/macOS/Windows, both single-player and multiplayer.\n\n**See also**\n\n*   [Release notes](https://github.com/spacechase0/StardewValleyMods/blob/develop/JumpOver/docs/release-notes.md#release-notes)\n\n*   [Source code](https://github.com/spacechase0/StardewValleyMods)",
